# Asher Project State

Asher is a mod manager for Dust: An Elysian Tail. The frontend is an **Electron** app (`Asher.Electron`). The backend is a C# console process (`Asher.Host`) communicating over **JSONL on stdin/stdout**. Windows and Linux are supported; platform specifics live in `docs/Cross-Platform-Architecture.md`.

## Completed (do not reimplement)

- Electron shell: sidebar, home hub, settings, patch manager, game setup; localization (en-US/pt-BR/es), Light/Dark theme, Material Symbols, toasts, install Finish UX
- Install / uninstall / launch / mod-toggle flows through the JSONL contract (`IAsherApplication`); install always creates a game backup; `setModEnabled` validates existence; incremental mod-list rendering
- Install payload bundled beside the Host (`install-payload/`); Windows zip + `Distribution/` packaging (`npm run dist` / `npm run publish`)
- Windows: launcher swap (`DustAET.exe` → `DustAET.real.exe`), emergency `Uninstall-Asher.cmd` (+ `.ps1`), Settings Removal (Safe uninstall / Total exclusion), GitHub Releases update check
- Platform abstraction (`IPlatformInfo` + discovery / executable-layout / runtime-deployment / process-launch contracts) with Windows and Linux implementations
- `getPlatformInfo` + explicit `getInstallState` (`state` / `canUninstall` / `canRestore` / `marker`); the renderer derives capabilities from them, not from `hasRestorableBackup`
- Linux: XDG/Steam discovery, bootstrap + managed runtime deployment (`install.json`), native `LD_PRELOAD` launch with game stdout/stderr kept off the JSONL channel, AppImage + tar.gz packaging
- `Asher.Services.Tests` (xUnit); Host-side projects (`Asher.Core`, `Asher.Services`, `Asher.Host`) target `net8.0`

## Retired (do not recreate)

- WPF UI: `Asher.App`, `Asher.UserInterface`, `Asher.Localization`
- WPF-only services: `ManagerLaunch`, `Shortcut`, `InstallationState`, `NavigationItemsManager`
- `PrepareDistribution.ps1`
- Prism / MaterialDesign / WPF dependencies in `Asher.Core`
- Portable-as-primary packaging (replaced by zip / `Distribution/`)

## Deferred

- Full install wizard stepper chrome
- Content patcher UI (no backend exists)
- Desktop shortcut creation after install
- Linux: external Steam/desktop launch, in-app updater, `.deb`; `mono_thread_attach` timing fix

